v><button data-rid="65ea756f-218b-4ab4-aaf7-5c3cab488303" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-1ymdy5y alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="4edd45f8-a3b2-4428-a74a-ece1d92e467d" class="r-1gtrkdr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Shop Now</p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="ee0189d8-98a8-413a-85c8-9d7d9f9f76a6" class="r-1gp9av4"><div data-rid="f2f9a225-2704-4a9e-92b6-ed445e38091a" class="r-jd2cmb"><div data-rid="69c0fb20-a8cb-421c-9724-290749510b96" class="r-du0jyv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>faq</p></span></div><div data-rid="359848b4-c123-4fa3-80f8-d8b17e95c37c" class="r-a0se8r" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5010e0fe-db20-4414-ab6e-9e7e3d546a36" class="r-2qiyrb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a30adce5-0b82-42d3-99f5-c033cbb87e23" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R3bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1s7ax5l"><div data-rid="e390b0da-9683-4555-af64-be7e8be1fe2a" class="r-lf16y3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Is my seafood fresh or frozen?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="9032c356-036b-47d3-91ed-7c452c2367e7" class="r-1odi18y r-jo339y"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1d54hbz r-g92vy8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h7a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-7A.5.5 0 0 1 4 8"></path></svg></div></div><div id="replo-:R3bj2:" aria-controls="replo-:R3bj2:" aria-expanded="true"><div data-rid="45c41a59-6526-401b-baae-c4837bcd8ce8" class="r-ik77o1"><div data-rid="9d89f8e2-58b7-4494-ab4e-b8dbdda64b1e" class="r-1kxz4ys alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Your seafood will be super-frozen with liquid nitrogen at peak freshness to lock in its flavor, nutrients and texture until you're ready to enjoy it. Unlike seafood at the grocery store that can be sitting out for unknown lengths of time or thawed on arrival - gradually degrading in quality and flavor until it’s purchased.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cd41dd64-e61a-49a2-b0d4-c32c22464834" class="r-1tzbkac" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="eb444128-efd3-4652-bdd3-e8e242b22ba4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1e2wapv"><div data-rid="dbd034b3-2b27-402d-aabf-91e643f89d89" class="r-1kfi56b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Do I have to be home for delivery?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="34d03a9e-b1c4-479b-8559-bba2d3460f75" class="r-zyf8ph"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-pqrmhn" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5bj2:" aria-controls="replo-:R5bj2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="2c1656cc-c948-4d12-8697-3f13090dd960" class="r-5nvh3y"><div data-rid="4da45eb4-5c80-4204-9917-29d89787e749" class="r-1ywvcw3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Your fish arrives frozen in an eco-friendly, insulated box with the perfect amount of dry ice to keep your seafood frozen until the end of your scheduled delivery day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="859a56bf-17f0-4b80-9c5d-082ec836bc33" class="r-1n56i5k" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="eae7d277-bccb-42fa-8dfd-48daa1463511" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ika52"><div data-rid="f9e8dd40-92a4-42ae-84f0-016bb7e4efeb" class="r-rzt1uo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Why a membership?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="0fb9c433-da81-4e87-9806-f1273d32fd66" class="r-3ks64v"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1gnbwvc" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7bj2:" aria-controls="replo-:R7bj2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="0f6768b4-c8c1-43b2-a2c9-4a56b2f42714" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1b46ozi"><div data-rid="7006dc11-acf0-45c5-9a72-583e01d5fb72" class="r-16z302z alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>A Seatopia membership is like a Community Supported Seafood box, bridging the gap between you and sustainable aquafarms. This model allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. In line with the Slow Food Movement, we're stepping away from impersonal, commodity-based supply chains. Subscriptions are flexible—you get preferred pricing, and can adjust or cancel anytime. This isn't just about buying seafood; it's a pact for a sustainable, transparent food system.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6a5e7e34-1e6e-4979-bf4d-e6973a6089e0" class="r-vb1ojk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d221bc64-3ef7-4d2b-87e2-cb1c678bc4f6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6m5rbw"><div data-rid="6f07012d-29ad-47b5-be10-8cda0bcaf7d9" class="r-ju4qn3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Why choose farmed instead of wild-caught?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="4cdb2529-069e-4c30-8bfc-f8bc91ba51fa" class="r-kj63gg"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-149xrny" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9bj2:" aria-controls="replo-:R9bj2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="d5341dbe-ad51-48b0-828c-f15cf53b4cec" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" tabindex="-1" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1fbm80n"><div data-rid="7025ba45-30b1-4ca2-9c54-ce3689318802" class="r-1b33xuv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br>Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</p></span></div><div data-rid="663f9a05-01e8-4d8d-aebe-32da18e58c39" class="r-dmrdnx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br>Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</p></span></div><div data-rid="51a9de04-8f68-4cc1-b684-a160e59fcbdc" class="r-l35y5z alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br>Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</p></span></div><div data-rid="af134334-b031-4829-8d0c-09e1d1bba509" class="r-1sdvok2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>No Antibiotics or Hormones<br></strong>We're committed to raising our seafood without the use of antibiotics or hormones. This aligns with our ethos of providing you with the cleanest, most natural products possible.</p></span></div><div data-rid="b7515110-de12-443c-abb6-f9e42dcdcea1" class="r-6j5lui alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Sustainability & Scalability</strong><br>Our approach to aquaculture is not only sustainable but also scalable. This ensures that we can continue to provide high-quality seafood while having a minimal impact on marine ecosystems.</p></span></div><div data-rid="e94bcfac-3777-46bc-b804-ca6342929704" class="r-rejgzs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>So when you choose Seatopia's farm-raised seafood, you're opting for a product that's superior in quality, nutritional value, and environmental impact. Learn more.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0d61f8e6-365d-41f5-a0d6-421451b94701" class="r-1o11i78" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="bffcac92-3be0-4dd2-99e2-3932f314f2b4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-23kmgd"><div data-rid="40e2a339-a3aa-4aba-ab73-3bfc13e6b2e9" class="r-1eis8xl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I skip or cancel?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="915315d0-821f-4fd9-8757-19d455822c5e" class="r-w7du80"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1hkqatj" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbbj2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rbbj2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="8c589203-86c2-478e-a5a5-cb9e4f71f427" class="r-5qaztj"><div data-rid="05bd5433-d06e-4a3f-bd84-90de5661f72e" class="r-1pvhfl9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Yes. You can adjust your delivery schedule, plan type, frequency and even cancel completely through your online account portal. If you'd prefer, chat with us and we'll help customize your Membership to meet your exact preferences and schedule.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="98ea47e8-117c-47dd-919b-4855eecdc2b5" class="r-mwygvp"><div data-rid="75d86401-0f9a-482d-af8e-a10ad8b0ba6c" class="r-1cultw4"><picture data-rid="e781456e-e3e5-4f25-94f9-e52e626aa314" class="r-151yird"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_b8570538-e8d9-4f91-9eb4-696f05f521da.png?v=1706701347&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_b8570538-e8d9-4f91-9eb4-696f05f521da.png?v=1706701347&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_b8570538-e8d9-4f91-9eb4-696f05f521da.png?v=1706701347&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_b8570538-e8d9-4f91-9eb4-696f05f521da.png?v=1706701347" class="r-18vckst" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="c36c4902-e4a2-4e13-83bc-b39899ca0f9d" class="r-tid3gn"><div class="klaviyo-form-XvBPTm"></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5f392a1e-cde5-41c7-b046-deb052b40d80" class="r-1gc5e8t"><picture data-rid="de9ee9c3-3cc6-4fdc-a776-db4f685b548e" class="r-1byvn18"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=1706632867&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=1706632867&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_1.png?v=17066